+## HTTPS
+
+To serve the REST API, UI, and gRPC over TLS, provide a certificate and private key:
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  https_port: 443
+  grpc_port: 9000
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/cert.pem
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/key.pem
+```
+
+The certificate and key files must exist when Flipt starts. `server.http_port` remains the port used when `server.protocol` is `http`.
+
+`cors.allowed_origins` accepts either one origin or a YAML list of origins.
+
 ## Databases
 
 Flipt supports both [SQLite](https://www.sqlite.org/index.html) and [Postgres](https://www.postgresql.org/) databases as of `v0.5.0`.
